:: Forest Hunter Nod
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

"Good," <<he>> says with a curt nod. Eden ties <<his>> end of the leash around a wooden beam.

<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Forest Cabin]]>><<set $forestleashed to 1>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Forest Hunter Refuse
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

"You don't mean that," <<he>> says. "It's safer for you here. You'll learn." <<He>> grabs you and bends you over <<his>> lap. "But I can't let you get away with being so insolent."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Forest Hunter Punishment]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Forest Hunter Punishment
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<maninit>><<npcspank>><<set $enemyhealth to 600>><<set $enemyhealthmax to 600>><<set $enemyanger += 200>>
	<<if $phase is 1>>
		<<npcoral>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<man>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend or $enemyanger lte 0>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Forest Hunter Punishment Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Forest Hunter Punishment]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Forest Hunter Punishment Finish
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	<<He>>【은는】 힘겹게 숨을 몰아쉰다. "교훈을 얻었으면 좋겠군."
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> 당신은 <<his>> 시선을 피한다.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[다음|Forest Cabin]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>

	"You ungrateful brat," <<he>> says. "Should've left you for the wolves." <<He>> winces and holds <<his>> side. "I need to get something for this."
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> 당신은 몸을 추스른다.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[다음|Forest Cabin]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyanger lte 0>>
	<<He>>【은는】 누그러진 듯 보이더니 당신을 놓아준다. "이제 교훈을 좀 얻었으면 좋겠군."
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> 당신은 <<his>> 시선을 피한다.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[다음|Forest Cabin]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Forest Cabin
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

<<npc Eden>><<person1>>
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	<<towelup>>
<</if>>

<<if $forestleashed is 1>>
	<<if C.npc.Eden.trust gte 200>>
		<span class="green">Eden unties the leash from the wooden beam.</span> "You've been a good <<girl>>. Stick to the cabin and the clearing just outside."
		<<set $forestleashed to 0>>
	<<else>>
		당신은 나무 기둥에 목줄로 단단히 묶여 있어 탈출할 수 없다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<if C.npc.Eden.trust lt 100>>
		<span class="red">Eden ties your leash to a wooden beam.</span> "You've been a bad <<girl>>. You'll have to learn to be good."
		<br><br>
		<<set $forestleashed to 1>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<<if $forestleashed isnot 1>>
	<<if $syndromeeden is undefined>>
		<<badEndTrackingEnd "Eden" { reason: "edenAccepted" }>>
		<<set $syndromeeden to 1>><<set C.npc.Eden.lust to 0>><<set $edenshrooms to 0>><<set $edengarden to 0>><<set $edenspring to 0>><<set $wardrobes.edensCabin.unlocked to true>>
		<span class="red"><i>It's lonely in the woods. Eden just wants company.</i>
		<br>
		"스톡홀름 증후군: 에덴" 특성을 획득했습니다.</span>
		<br><br>

		<<specialClothesUnlock "item" "loincloth">>
		<<loveInterestAdd "Eden">>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [[다음|Eden Cabin]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>

<<else>>
	<<if Time.hour lte 6>>
		Eden leads you to the bed.
		<<if $forestleashed is 1>>
			<<He>>【은는】 당신의 목줄을 침대 머리판의 난간에 감아 꼼짝 못하게 고정한다.
		<</if>>
		<<He>> leers at you, a ravenous look in <<his>> eyes. "<<print either("Don't struggle.",
		"You'll learn to enjoy it too.",
		"Be good.",
		"Hold still.",
		"Let me have this.",
		"Serve your purpose.",
		"I'll make you enjoy it.")>>"
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Cabin Night Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<br>

	<<elseif Time.hour lte 8>>
		Eden wraps the leash around a chair as <<he>> prepares breakfast. Shortly after, <<he>> places a plate of berries with some honeycomb on the table to share.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Eat with Eden (2:00)|Forest Cabin Food]]>><<npcincr Eden trust 10>><<sub 1>><<pass 2 hours>><</link>><<gtrust>><<gstockholm>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Shove the food away (2:00)|Forest Cabin Spit]]>><<npcincr Eden trust -10>><<def 1>><<pass 2 hours>><</link>><<ltrust>><<lstockholm>>
		<br>

	<<elseif Time.hour lte 16>>
		에덴이 당신을 밖으로 이끌고 나가 <<his>> 일과를 시작한다.
		<<if $forestleashed is 1>>
			<<He>>【은는】 양손을 써야 할 때면 당신의 목줄을 나무에 묶어두고, 항상 가까이에 둔다.
		<<else>>
			<<He>>【은는】 항상 당신을 가까이에 둔다.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[얌전히 있는다|Forest Cabin Good]]>><<sub 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<if $forestleashed is 1>>
			<<link [[목줄을 약하게 만든다|Forest Cabin Weaken]]>><<def 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>

	<<elseif Time.hour lte 18>>
		Eden runs a bath. <<He>> eases <<his>> body into the water, and looks at you expectantly. "Get in and wash me."
		<br><br>

		<<link [[씻겨준다 (2:00)|Cabin Bath]]>><<pass 2 hours>><<npcincr Eden trust 10>><<sub 1>><</link>><<gtrust>><<gstockholm>>
		<br>
		<<link [[거부한다 (2:00)|Cabin Bath Refuse]]>><<pass 2 hours>><<npcincr Eden trust -10>><<def 1>><</link>><<ltrust>><<lstockholm>>
		<br>

	<<elseif Time.hour lte 20>>
		Eden wraps your leash around a chair while <<he>> prepares dinner. Shortly after, <<he>> places a plate of meat and mushrooms on the table to share.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Eat with Eden (2:00)|Forest Cabin Dinner]]>><<npcincr Eden trust 10>><<sub 1>><<pass 2 hours>><</link>><<gtrust>><<gstockholm>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Shove the food away (2:00)|Forest Cabin Spit]]>><<npcincr Eden trust -10>><<def 1>><<pass 2 hours>><</link>><<ltrust>><<lstockholm>>
		<br>

	<<elseif Time.hour lte 22>>
		에덴이 자리에 앉아 책을 읽으며 벽난로에 불을 지핀다.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Cuddle (2:00)|Cabin Cuddle]]>><<sub 1>><<npcincr Eden trust 20>><<npcincr Eden love 1>><<pass 2 hours>><</link>><<glove>><<gtrust>><<ggstockholm>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Catch some sleep (2:00)|Forest Cabin]]>><<def 1>><<tiredness -12>><<tiredness -12>><<pass 2 hours>><<endevent>><</link>><<ltiredness>>
		<br>

	<<else>>
		Eden leads you to the bed.
		<<if $forestleashed is 1>>
			<<He>>【은는】 당신의 목줄을 침대 머리판의 난간에 감아 꼼짝 못하게 고정한다.
		<</if>>
		<<He>> leers at you, a ravenous look in <<his>> eyes. "<<print either("Don't struggle.",
		"You'll learn to enjoy it too.",
		"Be good.",
		"Hold still.",
		"Let me have this.",
		"Serve your purpose.",
		"I'll make you enjoy it.")>>"
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Cabin Night Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Cabin Night Rape
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<maninit>><<set $enemyhealth to 600>><<set $enemyhealthmax to 600>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<man>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Cabin Night Rape Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Cabin Night Rape]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Cabin Night Rape Finish
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	에덴이 한숨을 내쉬며 <<his>> 등을 바닥에 대고 눕는다. 곧 <<his>> 코 고는 소리가 들려온다.
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	에덴이 눈치를 채고는, 당신에게서 등을 돌려 옆으로 눕는다. 곧 <<his>> 코 고는 소리가 들려온다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<tearful>> 당신은 뭘 해야 할지 막막하다.
<br><br>

<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>

<<link [[다음|Cabin Night]]>><</link>>

:: Cabin Night
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

<<if $forestleashed is 1>>
	에덴은 잠들어 있지만, 목줄이 침대에 단단히 묶여 있어 멀리 움직일 수 없다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[잠자기|Cabin Night Sleep]]>><<cabintime>><</link>><<ltiredness>>
	<br>
	<<link [[목줄을 약하게 만든다|Cabin Night Leash]]>><<cabintime true>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	에덴은 잠들어 있다. 원한다면 탈출할 수 있다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[잠자기|Cabin Night Sleep]]>><<cabintime>><</link>><<ltiredness>>
	<br>
	<<link [[탈출한다|Cabin Night Escape]]>><<set $stress -= 2000>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Cabin Night Sleep
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

<<npc Eden>><<person1>>
당신은 자리에 누워 잠을 청한다.
<br><br>

You are awoken a while later by Eden's weight shifting the bed. <<He>> yawns and stretches, then looks at you. "Come on. We need to start the day."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Forest Cabin]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Cabin Night Leash
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

<<if $forestleashedwear gte 1>>
	<<set $forestleashedwear += 1>>
<<else>>
	<<set $forestleashedwear to 1>>
<</if>>

목줄을 침대 머리판에 문질러 닳게 하려 한다. 목줄이 얇아지는 듯하다.
<br><br>

<<if $forestleashedwear gte 3>>
	목줄이 끊어지자 햇살이 당신의 얼굴을 어루만진다. 당신은 자유로워졌다.<<stress -24>><<lllstress>>
	<br><br>

	에덴은 여전히 잠들어 있다. <span class="gold">탈출을 막을 것은 아무것도 없다.</span>
	<<detach_leash>>
	<<set $forestleashed to 0>><<set $forestleashedwear to 0>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[가만히 있는다|Cabin Leash Broken]]>><</link>><<gtrust>><<gggstockholm>>
	<br>
	<<link [[탈출한다|Cabin Night Escape]]>><</link>><<lllstockholm>>
	<br>

<<else>>
	<<npc Eden>><<person1>>
	얼마 후 에덴이 뒤척이는 소리가 들린다. <<He>>【은는】 몸을 돌려 당신의 뺨에 키스한다. "좋은 아침." <<He>>【은는】 하품하며 기지개를 켠다. "아침 먹을 시간이야."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Forest Cabin]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Cabin Night Escape
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

오두막 입구로 몰래 다가가 문손잡이를 돌려본다. 문이 열리자, 숲속으로 빠져나간다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Forest]]>><<npcincr Eden trust -200>><<set $forest to 80>><<if !$syndromeeden>><<badEndTrackingEnd "Eden" { reason: "edenEscapeNight" }>><</if>><</link>>
<br>

:: Cabin Leash Broken
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

<<npc Eden>><<person1>>
A while later you hear Eden stir. <<He>> yawns and stretches, then looks at you. "Come on. We need to start the day." <<He>> notices your broken leash. <<He>> grabs the remains, and looks at them for a moment. "Well. Seems like you're learning to be a good <<girl>>."
<<npcincr Eden trust 200>>
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Eden.trust gte 100>>
	"I don't think keeping you tied is necessary any more. Stick to the cabin and the clearing just outside."

	<<if $syndromeeden is undefined>>
		<<badEndTrackingEnd "Eden" { reason: "edenAccepted" }>>
		<<set $syndromeeden to 1>><<set C.npc.Eden.lust to 0>><<set $edenshrooms to 0>><<set $edengarden to 0>><<set $edenspring to 0>><<set $wardrobes.edensCabin.unlocked to true>>
		<br><br>

		<span class="red"><i>It's lonely in the woods. Eden just wants company.</i>
		<br>
		"스톡홀름 증후군: 에덴" 특성을 획득했습니다.</span>
		<br><br>

		<<loveInterestAdd "Eden">>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Eden.trust gte 100>>
	<<link [[다음|Eden Cabin]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[다음|Forest Cabin]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Forest Cabin Food
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<wearProp `either("blackberry", "strawberry", "wild honeycomb")`>><<canvas-model-override "mouth" "chew">>

You eat the food alongside Eden. <<He>> doesn't start any conversations, and anything you start dies quickly. Eden allows you to have your fill before eating the rest, leaving the plate empty.
<br><br>

<<He>> stands when <<he>> finishes, and looks out the window.

<<if Weather.precipitation is "none">>
	"We have work to do."
<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
	"Best start before the weather gets worse."
<<elseif Weather.is("heavyClouds")>>
	"The weather looks bad. Best start now."
<<elseif Weather.isFreezing>>
	"It's cold today. Keep warm."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Forest Cabin]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Forest Cabin Dinner
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<wearProp `either("steak", "honeyed pork", "mushroom")`>><<canvas-model-override "mouth" "chew">>

You eat the food alongside Eden. <<He>> doesn't start any conversations, and anything you start dies quickly. Eden allows you to have your fill before eating the rest, leaving the plate empty.
<br><br>

<<He>> stands when <<he>> finishes, and heads towards the fireplace.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Forest Cabin]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Forest Cabin Spit
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

You shove the plate away from you. The food spills over Eden and across the floor. <<He>> stands up, already annoyed. "I worked for that." <<He>> grabs you and bends you over <<his>> lap. "You'll learn what it's worth."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Forest Hunter Punishment]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Cabin Cuddle
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

You snuggle up to Eden. <<He>> tenses for a moment, then places an arm around you. <<He>> pulls you uncomfortably tight to <<his>> body.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Forest Cabin]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Cabin Bath
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<wearProp "sponge">>

You remove your clothing and get in the bath. Using a sponge, you wash <<his>> back. <<He>> turns to you. "Clean my chest." You continue washing, though it's more embarrassing when you can see <<his>> face.
<<wash>><<garousal>><<arousal 1000>>

<br><br>
<<link [[다음|Forest Cabin]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Cabin Bath Refuse
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

<<He>>【은는】 당신의 목줄을 잡아당겨 욕조로 끌고 가 <<his>> 무릎 위에 엎드리게 한다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Forest Hunter Punishment]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<npcexpose>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Forest Cabin Weaken
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

들키지 않도록 조심하며 목줄을 나무에 문지른다. 목줄이 얇아지는 듯하다.
<br><br>

Some time later, Eden pants and stretches while looking at the setting sun. <<He>> unties your leash from the tree, and leads you inside. "I need a bath. Let's go home."
<<if $forestleashedwear gte 1>>
	<<set $forestleashedwear += 1>>
<<else>>
	<<set $forestleashedwear to 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 8 hours>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Forest Cabin Good
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>

Some time later, Eden pants and stretches while looking at the setting sun. <<He>> unties your leash from the tree, and leads you inside. "I need a bath. Let's go home."

<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 8 hours>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
